# Site build: sitegen's own needs, the chock engine's PyPI runtime dependencies at
# .framework-ref, and its build backend (the engine installs with --no-deps
# --no-build-isolation, so every package comes from a lock file checked by hash).
# agentseam is pinned here by version (PyPI, hashed). Any git-pinned dependency would not be: pip cannot hash a
# git source, so scripts/install_engine_deps.py installs them --no-deps after the engine.
# Regenerate the .txt with:
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 requirements-build.in -o requirements-build.txt
